      "id": "fast-slow",
      "name": "快慢指標：鏈結串列找環",
      "trigger_signal": "鏈結串列是否有環；延伸可找中點。",
      "keywords": [
        "快慢指標",
        "找環",
        "鏈結串列",
        "中點"
      ],
      "prerequisites": [
        "每節點只有一個 next；比較節點身分而非節點值。",
        "空串列回傳 false。型別宣告包含於範例中，移植至平台時沿用平台節點定義。"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        {
          "scenario": "兩個不同節點的 val 都是 1。",
          "reason": "值相等不代表指標相遇；必須比較是否指向同一節點。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "slow 每次走一步，fast 走兩步。有環時相對距離每次改變一步，最終相遇；無環時 fast 到達結尾。若改求中點，保留相同步幅但回傳 slow，偶數長度得到第二個中點；不可把此判環回傳值當中點。",
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)",
        "reason": "最多走過非環前綴與環的常數倍長度，只保留兩個節點指標。"
      },
      "code": {
        "python": {
          "lines": [
            "class ListNode:",
            "    def __init__(self, val=0, next=None):",
            "        self.val, self.next = val, next",
            "",
            "def has_cycle(head):",
            "    slow = fast = head",
            "    while fast is not None and fast.next is not None:  # 先檢查再走兩步",
            "        slow = slow.next",
            "        fast = fast.next.next",
            "        if slow is fast:  # 比較身分，不是值",
            "            return True",
            "    return False"
          ]
        },
        "java": {
          "lines": [
            "class ListNode {",
            "    int val;",
            "    ListNode next;",
            "    ListNode(int val) { this.val = val; }",
            "}",
            "class Solution {",
            "    public boolean hasCycle(ListNode head) {",
            "        ListNode slow = head, fast = head;",
            "        while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {",
            "            slow = slow.next;",
            "            fast = fast.next.next;",
            "            if (slow == fast) return true; // 身分相等",
            "        }",
            "        return false;",
            "    }",
            "}"
          ]
        },
        "cpp": {
          "lines": [
            "struct ListNode {",
            "    int val;",
            "    ListNode* next;",
            "    explicit ListNode(int value) : val(value), next(nullptr) {}",
            "};",
            "bool hasCycle(ListNode* head) {",
            "    ListNode* slow = head;",
            "    ListNode* fast = head;",
            "    while (fast != nullptr && fast->next != nullptr) {",
            "        slow = slow->next;",
            "        fast = fast->next->next;",
            "        if (slow == fast) return true; // 同一節點位址",
            "    }",
            "    return false;",
            "}"
          ]
        }
      },
